4. Ask ONE discovery question: "Is there anything specific holding you back?" or "Do you have any questions I can clear up?" or "Would a follow-up reminder in a few days be helpful?"

**Convert:** Save the quotation. Offer a follow-up reminder. Suggest alternative package options if their needs have changed.

**If still hesitant:** "No problem at all — I've noted the package for you. Whenever you're ready, just send a message and we'll pick up right where we left off."

